    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Odra Online \u2013 A Multiplayer Turn-Based Strategy in Gothic Fantasy Style. Enter a world of tactical battles where every move matters. With 83 unique units, 66 dynamic arenas, over 450 battle variations, ranked matches, tournaments, and co-op battles, there\u2019s always room for new strategies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIGHT ON TACTICAL ARENAS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel the intensity of battle across 66 unique arenas, each with its own mechanics and ever-changing conditions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347800/extras/b9faf83822ed2141e078acf1a0349c8c.poster.avif?t=1748592537\" width=690 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347800/extras/b9faf83822ed2141e078acf1a0349c8c.webm?t=1748592537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347800/extras/b9faf83822ed2141e078acf1a0349c8c.mp4?t=1748592537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different battle types, shifting environments, time-of-day effects, traps, and destructible objects make every fight a fresh challenge. You never know what\u2019s coming next, as the system constantly generates new battlefield combinations.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ASSEMBLE LEGENDARY UNITS AND LEAD THEM TO VICTORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build an army of 83 units with different classes, ranks, and upgrades. Train your fighters, unlock new abilities, and adapt your strategy for each opponent. Flexibility and experimentation determine the outcome of battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347800/extras/dad9fda4a0f0e08b62bfb93bd07de9c1.poster.avif?t=1748592537\" width=690 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347800/extras/dad9fda4a0f0e08b62bfb93bd07de9c1.webm?t=1748592537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347800/extras/dad9fda4a0f0e08b62bfb93bd07de9c1.mp4?t=1748592537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CLIMB THE RANKS AND COMPETE IN TOURNAMENTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advance through 15 ranks across 4 ratings, competing against skilled tacticians. Tournaments and challenges change the rules, forcing you to adapt your strategy. Only those who adjust will prevail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347800/extras/2a157dbb25a31ae7211d88bd32586e54.poster.avif?t=1748592537\" width=690 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347800/extras/2a157dbb25a31ae7211d88bd32586e54.webm?t=1748592537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347800/extras/2a157dbb25a31ae7211d88bd32586e54.mp4?t=1748592537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TOTAL CONTROL OVER EVERY BATTLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The intuitive interface lets you command units with ease and make split-second tactical decisions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347800/extras/39bcbd900a71dd8e98f5d574e632acd8.poster.avif?t=1748592537\" width=690 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347800/extras/39bcbd900a71dd8e98f5d574e632acd8.webm?t=1748592537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347800/extras/39bcbd900a71dd8e98f5d574e632acd8.mp4?t=1748592537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Focus entirely on strategy without distractions\u2014everything you need for victory is at your fingertips.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TEAM UP FOR EPIC BATTLES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join forces with allies, create clans, and engage in co-op battles. Defend against enemy waves, fight rival teams, and prove your dominance. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347800/extras/5add736d07d1d62a6d4d3642e26576c1.poster.avif?t=1748592537\" width=690 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347800/extras/5add736d07d1d62a6d4d3642e26576c1.webm?t=1748592537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347800/extras/5add736d07d1d62a6d4d3642e26576c1.mp4?t=1748592537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With guild systems on the horizon, now is the time to gather your squad, form clans, and conquer arenas together.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CUSTOMIZE BATTLES AND CREATE UNIQUE CHALLENGES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize match settings and choose from 450+ battle variations in ranked mode. Define battle types, player count, difficulty level, and even time of day. Adapt, experiment, and outthink your opponents\u2014no two battles are ever the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347800/extras/48a058edec327eee41c93f5b69edefa1.poster.avif?t=1748592537\" width=690 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347800/extras/48a058edec327eee41c93f5b69edefa1.webm?t=1748592537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347800/extras/48a058edec327eee41c93f5b69edefa1.mp4?t=1748592537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CLASS SYSTEM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Odra Online features six classes: Warriors, Archers, Trappers, Leaders, Healers and Mages. Each unit plays a vital role: Warriors lead the charge, Archers strike from a distance, Trappers maneuver and ambush, Mages alter the battlefield, Healers sustain allies, and Leaders boost the team and shape tactics. Mastering class combinations is the key to victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347800/extras/30de250485e5fdf150c2b5fc43e7207f.poster.avif?t=1748592537\" width=690 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347800/extras/30de250485e5fdf150c2b5fc43e7207f.webm?t=1748592537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347800/extras/30de250485e5fdf150c2b5fc43e7207f.mp4?t=1748592537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>POWER IS IN YOUR HANDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control Power Points, manage resources, and unleash devastating abilities at the perfect moment. One smart move can turn the tide of battle\u2014use it wisely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347800/extras/a8c641878b079fbbabb5d817e5a325de.poster.avif?t=1748592537\" width=690 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347800/extras/a8c641878b079fbbabb5d817e5a325de.webm?t=1748592537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347800/extras/a8c641878b079fbbabb5d817e5a325de.mp4?t=1748592537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready for the challenge? Welcome to Odra Online, where strategy rules!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Odra Online \u2013 A Multiplayer Turn-Based Strategy in Gothic Fantasy Style. Enter a world of tactical battles where every move matters. With 83 unique units, 66 dynamic arenas, over 450 battle variations, ranked matches, tournaments, and co-op battles, there\u2019s always room for new strategies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FIGHT ON TACTICAL ARENAS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel the intensity of battle across 66 unique arenas, each with its own mechanics and ever-changing conditions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347800/extras/b9faf83822ed2141e078acf1a0349c8c.poster.avif?t=1748592537\" width=690 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347800/extras/b9faf83822ed2141e078acf1a0349c8c.webm?t=1748592537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347800/extras/b9faf83822ed2141e078acf1a0349c8c.mp4?t=1748592537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different battle types, shifting environments, time-of-day effects, traps, and destructible objects make every fight a fresh challenge. You never know what\u2019s coming next, as the system constantly generates new battlefield combinations.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ASSEMBLE LEGENDARY UNITS AND LEAD THEM TO VICTORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build an army of 83 units with different classes, ranks, and upgrades. Train your fighters, unlock new abilities, and adapt your strategy for each opponent. Flexibility and experimentation determine the outcome of battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_a