_assets/steam/apps/3347800/extras/48a058edec327eee41c93f5b69edefa1.poster.avif?t=1748592537\" width=690 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347800/extras/48a058edec327eee41c93f5b69edefa1.webm?t=1748592537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347800/extras/48a058edec327eee41c93f5b69edefa1.mp4?t=1748592537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CLASS SYSTEM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Odra Online features six classes: Warriors, Archers, Trappers, Leaders, Healers and Mages. Each unit plays a vital role: Warriors lead the charge, Archers strike from a distance, Trappers maneuver and ambush, Mages alter the battlefield, Healers sustain allies, and Leaders boost the team and shape tactics. Mastering class combinations is the key to victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347800/extras/30de250485e5fdf150c2b5fc43e7207f.poster.avif?t=1748592537\" width=690 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347800/extras/30de250485e5fdf150c2b5fc43e7207f.webm?t=1748592537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347800/extras/30de250485e5fdf150c2b5fc43e7207f.mp4?t=1748592537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>POWER IS IN YOUR HANDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control Power Points, manage resources, and unleash devastating abilities at the perfect moment. One smart move can turn the tide of battle\u2014use it wisely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347800/extras/a8c641878b079fbbabb5d817e5a325de.poster.avif?t=1748592537\" width=690 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347800/extras/a8c641878b079fbbabb5d817e5a325de.webm?t=1748592537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347800/extras/a8c641878b079fbbabb5d817e5a325de.mp4?t=1748592537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready for the challenge? Welcome to Odra Online, where strategy rules!</p>",
